Subject: [PATCH] Share original frontend pointer bounds and listener steps
Upstream-base: c7b2e663f878d38dc429ab12ee7db451daf0c217

Share original listener event order, disable history reset, rotated hit testing,
instance bounds and child extent equations with checked native retained owners.
Console methods delegate with original inputs. Global pointer-manager
registration, Wii DPD, controller speaker and hover rumble remain unselected.

